> >> ---
> >>  Documentation/arch/arm64/silicon-errata.rst |   6 ++
> >>  arch/arm64/Kconfig                          |  13 +++
> >>  drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v3-its.c            | 114 +++++++++++++++++---
